items.synopsisHtml:
A man with a shady past and a lot of money picks a boy to guide him across the southern border. The boy has no family and lives of scavenged trash, sets off with the man with the promise of fortune... but what awaits them?<br>
<br>
Debut one-shot of Waka Hirako, author of the award winning &quot;My Broken Mariko&quot;
